---
const project = {
  title: "BL’s Little Free Pantries",
  role: "UX/UI Designer, Developer and Content Creator",
  team: "BL’s Leadership Team",
  tools: "Figma, WordPress",
  release: "December 2024",
  image:
    "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/front-view-notebook-cup-coffee-inspiration-mock-up-concept-2-1024x554.jpg",
};

const skills = [
  "UX Research",
  "Information Architecture",
  "Wireframe",
  "UI Design",
  "Prototype",
  "Content Creation",
  "Web Development",
  "Collaboration",
  "SEO",
];

const images = {
  hero: "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/front-view-notebook-cup-coffee-inspiration-mock-up-concept-2-1024x554.jpg",

  personas: [
    "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Screenshot-2024-11-29-at-09.38.48-1024x459.png",
    "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Screenshot-2024-11-29-at-09.38.31-1024x467.png",
    "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Screenshot-2024-11-29-at-09.38.06-1024x463.png",
  ],

  journeyMap: "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Table-1.jpg",

  informationArchitecture:
    "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Screenshot-2024-11-24-at-20.26.35-1024x663.png",

  paperWireframes:
    "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/PXL_20241125_140811386-1024x789.jpg",

  digitalWireframes:
    "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Screenshot-2024-11-23-at-22.11.48-1024x387.png",

  highFidelity:
    "https://mytrion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Screenshot-2024-11-23-at-15.50.50-1024x573.jpg",
};
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{project.title} | Portfolio Case Study</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Portfolio case study for BL’s Little Free Pantries, a WordPress website designed and developed to centralize information, improve communication, and support community engagement."
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <main class="case-study">
      <a href="../" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>

      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero__content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Portfolio Case Study</p>
          <h1>{project.title}</h1>

          <p class="hero__text">
            A user-focused WordPress website designed and developed for a
            volunteer-driven organization providing free food, clothing, and
            essential items to people in need.
          </p>

          <div class="meta-grid">
            <div>
              <span>Role</span>
              <strong>{project.role}</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Team</span>
              <strong>{project.team}</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Tools</span>
              <strong>{project.tools}</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Release</span>
              <strong>{project.release}</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero__image">
          <img
            src={images.hero}
            alt="BL’s Little Free Pantries project mockup"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="tags">
          {skills.map((skill) => <span>{skill}</span>)}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section two-column">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Project Story</p>
          <h2>My Story with BL’s Little Free Pantries</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
          <p>
            BL’s Little Free Pantries is a volunteer-driven organization that
            provides free food, clothing, and essential items to those in need.
            Many users struggled to find clear information about food
            distribution, volunteering, donations, and partnership
            opportunities.
          </p>

          <p>
            Guided by BL’s team, I designed and developed a user-friendly
            WordPress website to centralize important information, streamline
            donations, highlight partnerships, and reduce repetitive messages
            for the leadership team.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section cards-section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Overview</p>
          <h2>Project Overview</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <p>
            Following user-centered design principles, I collaborated closely
            with the organization’s leadership to ensure the website aligned
            with their mission and provided a centralized platform for key
            information and user interaction.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Key Contributions</h3>

          <ul>
            <li>
              Conducted research on user needs and organizational challenges.
            </li>
            <li>Created wireframes and prototypes for the website.</li>
            <li>Designed a responsive and accessible user interface.</li>
            <li>
              Built the website on WordPress, ensuring scalability and ease of
              use for non-technical team members.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
          <h2>Understanding the User</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="content content--wide">
          <p>
            The website was created to address communication gaps and simplify
            the process for different types of users. Through user segment
            analysis, three key groups were identified: individuals seeking food
            assistance, volunteers, and sponsors.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="goal-grid">
          <article class="small-card">
            <h3>Food Recipients</h3>
            <p>
              Needed quick and easy access to clear information about
              distribution times, locations, and guidelines.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="small-card">
            <h3>Volunteers</h3>
            <p>
              Needed straightforward ways to learn about opportunities to help
              and understand the value of their contribution.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="small-card">
            <h3>Sponsors & Partners</h3>
            <p>
              Needed visibility, acknowledgment, and transparency around how
              their support created impact.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Challenges</p>
          <h2>Pain Points</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="goal-grid">
          <article class="small-card">
            <h3>Lack of Clear Information</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Food recipients could not easily find distribution details.
              </li>
              <li>Volunteers lacked guidance on how to help.</li>
              <li>Sponsors did not know how to support the organization.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="small-card">
            <h3>Communication Challenges</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Important updates were getting lost on Facebook.</li>
              <li>
                Non-Facebook users missed key information, limiting engagement.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="small-card">
            <h3>Overwhelmed Leadership</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Leadership received repeated questions about volunteering,
                donating, food access, and events.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section process">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Design Process</p>
          <h2>From Research to Prototype</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="process__item">
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Design Ideation</h3>
            <p>
              I gathered insights from user research and organized them visually
              to identify the most important website elements. The user journey
              was mapped for food recipients, volunteers, and sponsors.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process__item">
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Information Architecture</h3>
            <p>
              I developed the site structure to give food recipients,
              volunteers, and sponsors easy access to the information they
              needed most.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process__item">
          <span>03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Wireframes</h3>
            <p>
              I started with paper sketches to explore layout ideas, then moved
              into digital wireframes to define page structure and
              functionality.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process__item">
          <span>04</span>
          <div>
            <h3>High-Fidelity Prototype</h3>
            <p>
              I created realistic design mockups for testing, presentation, and
              final development direction.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="impact">
        <p class="eyebrow">Impact</p>
        <h2>A central hub for community support</h2>

        <p>
          The final website was designed to streamline communication and improve
          access to information for food recipients, volunteers, and sponsors.
          It gives the organization a central place to share food distribution
          schedules, volunteer opportunities, donation information, and
          sponsorship details.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --color-bg: #f7f7f3;
    --color-surface: #ffffff;
    --color-surface-soft: #f0f2ec;
    --color-text: #1d211c;
    --color-muted: #667064;
    --color-primary: #557c55;
    --color-primary-dark: #324d34;
    --color-border: #dfe5dc;
    --color-shadow: rgba(29, 33, 28, 0.08);

    --font-main:
      Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
      "Segoe UI", sans-serif;

    --container: 1120px;
    --radius-sm: 14px;
    --radius-md: 24px;
    --radius-lg: 36px;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    color: var(--color-text);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top right,
        rgba(85, 124, 85, 0.16),
        transparent 32rem
      ),
      var(--color-bg);
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  img {
    display: block;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .case-study {
    width: min(100% - 2rem, var(--container));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .hero__content,
  .hero__image,
  .card,
  .small-card,
  .process__item,
  .impact {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px var(--color-shadow);
  }

  .hero__content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 6.4rem);
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.075em;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  p,
  li {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .hero__text {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .hero__image {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .hero__image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .meta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .meta-grid div {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-surface-soft);
  }

  .meta-grid span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .meta-grid strong {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
  }

  .tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  .tags span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 38px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .two-column {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .content--wide {
    max-width: 920px;
  }

  .content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cards-section {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .card,
  .small-card,
  .process__item,
  .impact {
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .card ul,
  .small-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .goal-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .small-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .process {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .process__item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .process__item span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .process__item p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .impact {
    margin-top: 5rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(50, 77, 52, 0.94), rgba(85, 124, 85, 0.92)),
      var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .impact .eyebrow,
  .impact p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
  }

  .impact h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .impact p {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero,
    .two-column,
    .goal-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero__image {
      min-height: 320px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .case-study {
      width: min(100% - 1rem, var(--container));
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    .hero__content,
    .card,
    .small-card,
    .process__item,
    .impact {
      padding: 1.2rem;
    }

    .meta-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .process__item {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
